        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arenson9/{size}/1900_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-01-01T17:30:10.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Oh, man. I just took these three heroes up against regular Blade. Wanted to get an easy win to cleanse the palate.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Not so much.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I came close to losing on the front side due to cards (12 in the trash) AND hit points (everyone in single digits. Fixer got incapacitated. Tempest ended up spending his turns mostly healing and destroying Entry Points. Wraith finally got fully set up and was able to take out Blade with an Inventory Barrage.&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:13:28.050Z",
