        "id": 187643,
        "name": "phantaskippy",
        "username": "phantaskippy",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-01-01T18:10:26.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Stun Bolt friction, focus Proletariat, survive Blade.</p><p>That's the basic strategy I'd go with.</p><p>You can't really afford to have Tempest playing defense with that lineup, he needs to pump out damage to get rid of somebody (if you can't stun Fristion focus her first)</p><p>Ideally you get either damage or tank Fixer going, but hoist chain is a big help. &nbsp;Mantis is always amazing in Vengence format, but the biggest thing is keeping the entry points in check. &nbsp;Those will destroy you.</p>",
        "post_number": 5,
